  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed side dormer roof extension would appear as an incongruous addition to the host property and would cause unacceptable impacts on the character or appearance of the local area resulting in less than substantial harm to the significance of the Richmond Road Conservation Area which would not be outweighed by any public benefits. Therefore, the proposals fail to preserve the character and appearance of the Conservation Area, contrary to Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the Core Strategy (2012)."
